WEBVTT

00:00:05.714 --> 00:00:06.548
<i>Well, I'll be!</i>

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:09.843
<i>So they really are twins, huh?</i>

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:14.264
<i>I know you had told me before, ma'am,</i>

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:18.727
<i>but I couldn't believe it
until I saw it with my own eyes.</i>

00:00:19.436 --> 00:00:22.731
<i>That last match finally convinced me.</i>

00:00:24.899 --> 00:00:27.944
It's hard for both of us, isn't it?

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:31.281
Having to send our little boys
out to fight so recklessly

00:00:31.364 --> 00:00:34.034
when we already know
what the result will be

00:00:34.117 --> 00:00:37.328
thanks to our divination…

00:00:37.912 --> 00:00:39.831
That's why we came here

00:00:39.914 --> 00:00:42.375
to meet you in person,

00:00:43.084 --> 00:00:44.169
Mr. Tao.

00:02:16.177 --> 00:02:17.428
EPISODE 26
MIKIHISA TYPHOON

00:02:17.512 --> 00:02:20.014
I presume you're ready, Yoh?

00:02:38.908 --> 00:02:40.994
That's about the size of it.

00:02:41.077 --> 00:02:43.413
That's how Hao and I
were born as brothers.

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:46.583
I'm sorry I didn't tell you sooner.

00:02:47.584 --> 00:02:49.127
You must be wondering

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:51.212
how Hao survived

00:02:51.296 --> 00:02:53.506
after he flew off as a newborn baby.

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:55.341
We're good.

00:02:56.509 --> 00:02:59.596
Just thinking about it
makes me feel queasy…

00:03:00.597 --> 00:03:03.558
If he could use Spirit of Fire
as soon as he was born,

00:03:04.267 --> 00:03:07.020
there must be nothing he can't do.

00:03:07.103 --> 00:03:09.439
And as we saw in the last match,

00:03:09.522 --> 00:03:13.026
it must have gotten that big
by eating soul after soul.

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:17.280
One thing's for sure.
That guy's crazy powerful.

00:03:17.363 --> 00:03:18.823
I can't believe it…

00:03:19.407 --> 00:03:22.368
Hao's going to come for you one day, Yoh?

00:03:22.452 --> 00:03:24.954
Is that why you haven't
been harmed so far?

00:03:25.038 --> 00:03:27.040
What does he mean by his "other half"?

00:03:29.459 --> 00:03:30.627
Well…

00:03:31.419 --> 00:03:34.631
I always just intended
to be myself, anyway.

00:03:35.548 --> 00:03:36.549
I'm sorry.

00:03:36.633 --> 00:03:38.384
I didn't mean…

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:40.678
Don't sweat it.

00:03:40.762 --> 00:03:42.972
I don't really
understand it myself either.

00:03:44.057 --> 00:03:45.141
<i>"Other half," huh?</i>

00:03:45.975 --> 00:03:47.477
<i>They may be twins,</i>

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:50.271
<i>but that doesn't change
the fact that they're one being.</i>

00:03:51.022 --> 00:03:54.817
<i>He certainly does seem
like he's lacking certain emotions.</i>

00:03:55.485 --> 00:03:57.153
<i>He follows no doctrine.</i>

00:03:57.237 --> 00:03:59.697
<i>He's drawn to neither "good" nor "evil."</i>

00:04:00.323 --> 00:04:03.159
<i>Does he lack those things
because he's only a half?</i>

00:04:04.327 --> 00:04:05.245
<i>Or is it…</i>

00:04:06.829 --> 00:04:08.498
So what?

00:04:09.499 --> 00:04:13.419
It makes no difference to us what you are.

00:04:14.128 --> 00:04:16.589
You said you didn't want
to drag us into it,

00:04:17.215 --> 00:04:20.051
but if there's some kind of problem,
just come out with it.

00:04:21.636 --> 00:04:24.097
Hey! You mean there's something else?

00:04:24.180 --> 00:04:25.515
Don't!

00:04:25.598 --> 00:04:27.517
I can't take any more!

00:04:28.685 --> 00:04:30.853
-Ms. Anna…
-It's okay, Tamao.

00:04:32.146 --> 00:04:33.690
This is the important bit.

00:04:34.732 --> 00:04:35.775
This

00:04:36.401 --> 00:04:38.069
is what Yoh decided.

00:04:38.569 --> 00:04:39.988
Yoh…

00:04:41.614 --> 00:04:44.409
Silva told me that Hao's Mana

00:04:44.492 --> 00:04:46.995
is currently at 1,250,000.

00:04:47.662 --> 00:04:51.124
The problem is that no matter
how hard anyone else fights,

00:04:51.749 --> 00:04:53.876
Hao will win this tournament.

00:05:00.508 --> 00:05:03.469
Giving it our best shot
just won't cut it this time.

00:05:04.012 --> 00:05:05.680
I'm not giving up, though.

00:05:06.889 --> 00:05:08.641
That's why I'm telling you this.

00:05:10.184 --> 00:05:13.354
Our real battle will begin after this!

00:05:15.481 --> 00:05:19.027
Even an island like this has hot springs!

00:05:19.110 --> 00:05:21.154
This truly is the land of volcanoes.

00:05:21.863 --> 00:05:26.075
But this magnificent power that provides
the people with so many blessings

00:05:26.159 --> 00:05:29.620
becomes a deadly weapon
with just a single eruption.

00:05:30.246 --> 00:05:33.166
People are given life by nature

00:05:33.249 --> 00:05:36.085
before ultimately being killed by it.

00:05:37.253 --> 00:05:40.840
And there's nothing
anyone can do about it.

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:44.886
Thank you for coming all this way
just to report to me,

00:05:44.969 --> 00:05:46.846
Magna. Nickrome.

00:05:47.430 --> 00:05:49.307
We're just doing the right thing.

00:05:49.390 --> 00:05:53.561
Not that a nobody like Silva
getting up to no good

00:05:53.644 --> 00:05:55.605
is of too much concern.

00:05:55.688 --> 00:05:59.275
Though he does have
your blood in his veins, Lord Hao.

00:05:59.901 --> 00:06:03.362
Other Patches seem to be
acting suspiciously too.

00:06:05.573 --> 00:06:08.201
Let them do as they please.

00:06:08.868 --> 00:06:11.037
No matter what happens,

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:13.206
all we can do
is entrust ourselves to nature.

00:06:13.831 --> 00:06:18.753
We, Shamans, read the flow of nature
and choose the right course.

00:06:19.378 --> 00:06:21.589
Those who can't will perish.

00:06:22.507 --> 00:06:24.801
People have been too sinful.

00:06:26.385 --> 00:06:28.721
I will win this tournament

00:06:28.805 --> 00:06:33.309
and make the supreme power of nature,
the Great Spirit, my own.

00:06:34.102 --> 00:06:36.896
But only then will the real fight begin.

00:06:40.358 --> 00:06:43.694
That's why I need you.

00:06:46.572 --> 00:06:50.618
I believe it was just before
Ren returned to China

00:06:51.119 --> 00:06:55.456
that you, ma'am,
came as a messenger for the Asakuras

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:57.041
to tell us Taos

00:06:57.125 --> 00:07:01.504
that this Hao fellow
would win the Shaman Fight.

00:07:02.755 --> 00:07:05.007
It was nothing I didn't already know,

00:07:05.091 --> 00:07:07.385
but actually being confronted with reality

00:07:07.468 --> 00:07:10.680
can be so painful
when it makes you lose all hope.

00:07:10.763 --> 00:07:13.474
However, it can also be a relief.

00:07:13.558 --> 00:07:17.311
It makes you realize that making
those kids suffer to toughen them up

00:07:17.395 --> 00:07:19.439
was all worth it!

00:07:20.022 --> 00:07:22.900
That's how the Tao Family
has always done things,

00:07:22.984 --> 00:07:26.487
though we have gone too far many times.

00:07:28.072 --> 00:07:29.323
Mr. Tao.

00:07:29.407 --> 00:07:32.952
We didn't come here just to chat.

00:07:34.078 --> 00:07:36.539
It's a race against time.

00:07:36.622 --> 00:07:38.458
Will you grant

00:07:38.541 --> 00:07:40.877
our request?

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:48.134
You may have once marched
into the Tao Fortress all by yourself,

00:07:48.801 --> 00:07:50.636
but make no mistake!

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:52.138
The Tao Family

00:07:52.221 --> 00:07:55.641
is fighting for nothing
but its own personal revenge!

00:07:58.144 --> 00:08:01.898
If the implications
of that do not bother you,

00:08:01.981 --> 00:08:03.733
then we will gladly accept

00:08:03.816 --> 00:08:06.360
the power of Hao Asakura's treasured

00:08:06.444 --> 00:08:08.362
<i>Ultra Senji Ryakketsu!</i>

00:08:09.447 --> 00:08:13.367
I can guarantee that I will make
your grandson much stronger.

00:08:13.951 --> 00:08:15.328
I won't permit it.

00:08:19.081 --> 00:08:22.752
I raised Ren personally
to become the Shaman King.

00:08:22.835 --> 00:08:25.671
He's the masterpiece
of the Tao Family's 2,000-year history.

00:08:26.589 --> 00:08:31.511
Why would I entrust him
to some weak stranger

00:08:31.594 --> 00:08:33.763
I don't know the first thing about?

00:08:37.683 --> 00:08:38.726
Fight me!

00:08:40.102 --> 00:08:43.940
Prove just how mighty the power
of this<i> Ultra Senji Ryakketsu</i> is

00:08:44.023 --> 00:08:47.109
by besting me in battle!

00:08:49.153 --> 00:08:52.448
As a father myself,
I understand how you feel.

00:08:53.991 --> 00:08:56.118
That's fine by me.

00:08:57.995 --> 00:08:58.996
This is too much…

00:08:59.622 --> 00:09:02.959
I know Yoh said
the real battle is yet to come,

00:09:03.626 --> 00:09:07.004
but I still have no damn clue
what's going to happen.

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:13.636
I guess he'll fill us in on the details
after today's matches.

00:09:14.595 --> 00:09:18.182
I wonder if it's true
that Hao will win the tournament.

00:09:18.266 --> 00:09:19.892
It's hard to disagree with.

00:09:20.393 --> 00:09:23.729
His power is in
a whole other dimension than ours.

00:09:24.647 --> 00:09:25.648
Right.

00:09:26.148 --> 00:09:29.443
But if they already knew the outcome,

00:09:29.527 --> 00:09:31.737
why even bother with the Shaman Fight?

00:09:34.323 --> 00:09:37.702
Are you telling me
you can't make your own destiny?

00:09:38.744 --> 00:09:40.329
You can make it.

00:09:41.497 --> 00:09:44.750
Only if you have the power
to do so, however.

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:49.630
Although nobody is capable
of standing firm against Hao.

00:09:52.091 --> 00:09:53.301
Hey there!

00:09:54.635 --> 00:09:58.472
We've got a problem, Ren!
A weird man just appeared from nowhere!

00:10:01.142 --> 00:10:02.518
Your Mana…

00:10:03.102 --> 00:10:05.980
I've sensed it many times before.

00:10:06.063 --> 00:10:08.482
Oh, I knew you were good.

00:10:11.027 --> 00:10:13.279
But that keen Mana of yours

00:10:13.362 --> 00:10:15.906
gets surprisingly weak
when it's time to fight.

00:10:16.699 --> 00:10:18.117
Shall we put it to the test?

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:23.456
-What?
-What's he doing?

00:10:26.959 --> 00:10:28.461
Warding off that blow

00:10:29.670 --> 00:10:31.505
shows real physical prowess,

00:10:32.048 --> 00:10:33.633
but you rely too much on strength.

00:10:34.592 --> 00:10:37.178
And I applaud you for striking back,

00:10:37.261 --> 00:10:38.929
but if you don't look closely enough,

00:10:39.013 --> 00:10:41.057
you'll be left
punching the air like a fool.

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:43.934
This guy's trouble!

00:10:44.018 --> 00:10:45.144
You want a fight, huh?

00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:48.272
I told you to look closely!

00:10:50.107 --> 00:10:51.817
I won't be able

00:10:51.901 --> 00:10:54.320
to teach you
the <i>Ultra Senji Ryakketsu </i>like this!

00:10:57.031 --> 00:10:58.949
-He did it again!
-Wait.

00:10:59.742 --> 00:11:02.453
Did he just say <i>Ultra Senji Ryakketsu</i>?

00:11:03.037 --> 00:11:04.038
On the other hand,

00:11:04.121 --> 00:11:07.041
your enthusiasm is something
to be commended.

00:11:08.209 --> 00:11:09.210
Very well!

00:11:10.211 --> 00:11:11.754
I am Yoh's father,

00:11:11.837 --> 00:11:13.923
Mikihisa Asakura, 42.

00:11:14.006 --> 00:11:15.091
Certain circumstances

00:11:15.174 --> 00:11:18.302
have led to me coming here
to teach you the <i>Ultra Senji Ryakketsu.</i>

00:11:19.553 --> 00:11:20.930
Now, don't be shy!

00:11:21.555 --> 00:11:23.182
Keep giving me your best shots!

00:11:24.266 --> 00:11:26.894
-We've got a problem!
-He's Yoh's dad!

00:11:26.977 --> 00:11:28.354
Shut up!

00:11:28.437 --> 00:11:29.814
What does that matter?

00:11:30.398 --> 00:11:31.315
You're mad!

00:11:31.399 --> 00:11:32.525
Of course I am!

00:11:33.234 --> 00:11:36.278
<i>All these strange visitors I've had lately</i>

00:11:36.362 --> 00:11:37.613
<i>are pissing me off!</i>

00:11:38.989 --> 00:11:41.117
It seems the entire Asakura Family,

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:45.913
ancestors and descendants alike,
all enjoy mocking me.

00:11:46.539 --> 00:11:49.917
That's all just in your head.

00:11:50.501 --> 00:11:51.377
Be quiet.

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:54.255
I don't know what techniques
you have at your disposal,

00:11:54.338 --> 00:11:56.215
but underestimate me at your peril.

00:11:57.258 --> 00:12:00.094
You came here to teach us
the <i>Ultra Senji Ryakketsu</i>?

00:12:03.097 --> 00:12:04.056
Don't make me laugh!

00:12:04.974 --> 00:12:07.810
I have nothing to learn from an Asakura.

00:12:07.893 --> 00:12:08.978
Ren!

00:12:09.562 --> 00:12:11.647
This is the perfect opportunity

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:14.984
to test both my Lightning Sword
and how soft you are!

00:12:15.901 --> 00:12:16.986
Come forth, Bason!

00:12:18.279 --> 00:12:20.448
We're going to beat this man to a pulp!

00:12:21.449 --> 00:12:22.783
I see.

00:12:22.867 --> 00:12:25.494
So now you're going to test me?

00:12:25.995 --> 00:12:26.871
Very well.

00:12:27.496 --> 00:12:30.791
You shouldn't stick
to such stubborn assumptions, though.

00:12:37.882 --> 00:12:40.384
You will grow stronger yet.

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:46.765
For when someone abandons doubt,

00:12:46.849 --> 00:12:48.726
they abandon growth!

00:13:04.742 --> 00:13:06.577
Don't be an idiot!

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:08.579
That's Yoh's old man!

00:13:08.662 --> 00:13:11.165
Why are you so serious all of a sudden?

00:13:11.248 --> 00:13:12.541
Let's do this.

00:13:27.848 --> 00:13:31.852
You sure do like your cheap tricks,
don't you, Mikihisa Asakura?

00:13:32.478 --> 00:13:36.023
These doubles won't fool me anymore.

00:13:36.649 --> 00:13:40.444
Now, how about you cut
the crap and fight me properly?

00:13:42.738 --> 00:13:44.823
You worked it out already. Impressive.

00:13:44.907 --> 00:13:48.202
-There are three of Yoh's dads!
-There are three of Yoh's dads!

00:13:48.786 --> 00:13:53.582
But don't get cocky just because
you've seen through that much.

00:13:53.666 --> 00:13:56.961
The fact remains that you're surrounded

00:13:57.044 --> 00:13:58.546
by my Over Soul.

00:14:01.715 --> 00:14:03.842
To think that your mysterious techniques

00:14:03.926 --> 00:14:06.428
were nothing but a fox and a raccoon dog!

00:14:07.263 --> 00:14:08.764
Truly pathetic.

00:14:09.890 --> 00:14:12.393
The fact remains that I'm surrounded?

00:14:12.935 --> 00:14:15.229
I think you mean to say
that these two animals

00:14:15.312 --> 00:14:17.064
have come within my range!

00:14:18.274 --> 00:14:19.817
My intermediary,

00:14:20.568 --> 00:14:24.321
the Lightning Sword,
sharpens the souls of all spirits!

00:14:25.614 --> 00:14:27.366
Feast on this!

00:14:27.449 --> 00:14:30.035
My deadly Sword Mirage!

00:14:30.536 --> 00:14:32.538
SWORD MIRAGE

00:14:35.624 --> 00:14:37.418
What is this?

00:14:37.501 --> 00:14:39.795
It must be Ren's new technique!

00:14:42.089 --> 00:14:42.923
Child's play.

00:14:43.507 --> 00:14:44.800
Mere animal spirits.

00:14:45.801 --> 00:14:50.222
They're no match for
a general who boasts a 1,800-year history!

00:14:51.265 --> 00:14:53.767
<i>On the field of battle,</i>

00:14:53.851 --> 00:14:55.477
<i>Bason fought against all warriors,</i>

00:14:55.561 --> 00:14:56.812
<i>all weapons,</i>

00:14:56.896 --> 00:14:59.106
<i>and all martial arts.</i>

00:14:59.189 --> 00:15:01.025
<i>Then he vanquished them,</i>

00:15:01.108 --> 00:15:03.777
<i>thereby mastering all the secrets
of the art of war.</i>

00:15:03.861 --> 00:15:05.654
<i>He's an ultra general, if you will!</i>

00:15:06.238 --> 00:15:12.036
And with the aid of the Lightning Sword's
ability to sharpen all souls,

00:15:12.786 --> 00:15:15.247
Bason will evolve even further!

00:15:17.291 --> 00:15:19.209
Ren's Over Soul is…

00:15:20.461 --> 00:15:23.297
This is my new Over Soul.

00:15:24.173 --> 00:15:25.174
Bushin!

00:15:26.300 --> 00:15:28.928
Now, do you still want to continue?

00:15:29.011 --> 00:15:31.221
Your Over Soul is…

00:15:32.264 --> 00:15:34.558
What about my Over Soul?

00:15:35.893 --> 00:15:37.478
But they just got…

00:15:39.271 --> 00:15:40.356
Ren.

00:15:41.023 --> 00:15:43.192
Through fighting my son,

00:15:43.275 --> 00:15:46.695
you learned that spirits were not tools
and discovered friendship.

00:15:46.779 --> 00:15:49.031
Then you made up your mind,

00:15:49.114 --> 00:15:51.784
rebelled against your family
who went against your will,

00:15:51.867 --> 00:15:54.745
and vowed never to doubt again.

00:15:55.829 --> 00:15:57.581
So what?

00:15:58.707 --> 00:16:00.000
It's admirable.

00:16:00.084 --> 00:16:01.335
-It's a good thing?
-It's a good thing?

00:16:01.961 --> 00:16:05.297
But such fixed ideas
are merely temporary tricks

00:16:05.381 --> 00:16:08.509
used by weak-willed people
to keep control of their minds

00:16:08.592 --> 00:16:10.427
when they feel like they might waver.

00:16:10.928 --> 00:16:15.766
Do you plan on burying your head
in the sand your whole life?

00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:18.394
I am strong!

00:16:18.978 --> 00:16:20.020
If nothing else,

00:16:20.604 --> 00:16:23.482
I'm stronger than you
bunch of indecisive fools!

00:16:27.194 --> 00:16:28.070
Damn kid.

00:16:29.279 --> 00:16:30.155
<i>What the hell…</i>

00:16:30.823 --> 00:16:32.241
<i>happened?</i>

00:16:33.367 --> 00:16:35.244
<i>I didn't see a thing!</i>

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:37.037
<i>Will I</i>

00:16:37.621 --> 00:16:40.290
<i>lose to this kind of man?</i>

00:16:41.583 --> 00:16:43.168
No way!

00:16:54.430 --> 00:16:56.265
Four-Flash Blade Paradise:

00:16:56.849 --> 00:16:57.766
Spears!

00:16:59.935 --> 00:17:00.811
Swords!

00:17:02.521 --> 00:17:03.355
Halberds!

00:17:04.523 --> 00:17:05.733
Multiple Blades!

00:17:16.285 --> 00:17:18.454
Ren can't land anything!

00:17:18.537 --> 00:17:20.456
How did he dodge all that?

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:24.084
Did he switch back
to Over Soul at some point?

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:27.087
Over Souls don't have shadows.

00:17:27.755 --> 00:17:29.006
For real?

00:17:29.089 --> 00:17:31.800
This is Yoh's dad?

00:17:32.384 --> 00:17:35.095
Mikihisa Asakura is just too strong!

00:17:37.097 --> 00:17:40.100
I was shocked when I first heard it too.

00:17:40.184 --> 00:17:41.602
I mean, 1,250,000…

00:17:42.603 --> 00:17:44.772
You seem pretty calm.

00:17:44.855 --> 00:17:49.485
Well, it's a lot to take in all at once.

00:17:49.568 --> 00:17:53.530
Maybe that's easier
than just fretting over one thing.

00:17:53.614 --> 00:17:57.618
But what is this 1,250,000, anyway?

00:17:57.701 --> 00:18:00.704
Like I said, it's how much Mana he has.

00:18:00.788 --> 00:18:03.791
A number alone doesn't mean
all that much to me…

00:18:04.875 --> 00:18:09.546
I asked Silva about my Mana. He told me
it's around 10,000, or thereabouts.

00:18:10.506 --> 00:18:13.509
Apparently, the Patch Tribe has technology

00:18:13.592 --> 00:18:15.469
that can quantify Mana.

00:18:15.552 --> 00:18:16.845
It's not technology.

00:18:16.929 --> 00:18:18.555
It's traditional handicrafts.

00:18:18.639 --> 00:18:19.807
Same difference.

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:24.436
Apparently, you can measure it
with an Oracle Bell too.

00:18:25.062 --> 00:18:28.273
1,250,000 versus around 10,000?

00:18:29.983 --> 00:18:34.822
So even if there were 100 of you,
that still wouldn't be nearly enough!

00:18:37.991 --> 00:18:39.368
In that case,

00:18:39.451 --> 00:18:42.371
couldn't all the other
Shaman Fight competitors

00:18:42.454 --> 00:18:45.207
get together to defeat Hao somehow?

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:47.167
I'm not sure.

00:18:47.251 --> 00:18:49.419
That probably still wouldn't work.

00:18:50.462 --> 00:18:55.843
Spirit of Fire would just catch them
one by one, only making things worse.

00:18:55.926 --> 00:18:59.304
Not to mention,
I don't really like doing things that way.

00:19:00.639 --> 00:19:03.183
It's not really the time
to worry about things like that.

00:19:03.267 --> 00:19:04.560
What do you mean?

00:19:04.643 --> 00:19:06.687
That's why everyone's working so hard.

00:19:07.729 --> 00:19:08.981
Hey, Yoh.

00:19:09.064 --> 00:19:11.066
Shouldn't you better get going?

00:19:11.150 --> 00:19:12.317
Where to?

00:19:12.401 --> 00:19:13.402
"Where to"?

00:19:13.485 --> 00:19:16.321
To the boys, obviously! Where else?

00:19:16.905 --> 00:19:18.448
Right about now,

00:19:18.532 --> 00:19:21.451
Mikihisa will be beating
the snot out of your idiot friends.

00:19:21.535 --> 00:19:22.744
Right.

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:25.747
Yeah, he did mention something about that.

00:19:25.831 --> 00:19:28.041
Wait up! What's going on?

00:19:28.125 --> 00:19:29.042
Honestly.

00:19:29.626 --> 00:19:32.171
It always astounds me
how abrupt Mikihisa is.

00:19:32.880 --> 00:19:36.592
It's not like those guys are going
to calmly agree for him to teach them

00:19:36.675 --> 00:19:39.386
the <i>Ultra Senji Ryakketsu</i> out of nowhere.

00:19:39.970 --> 00:19:41.972
Especially Mr. Spiky.

00:19:42.472 --> 00:19:45.893
Right, because Ren's so hardheaded, huh?

00:19:46.476 --> 00:19:48.520
So his spike is hard too!

00:19:49.104 --> 00:19:51.190
Forget the spike!

00:19:51.273 --> 00:19:55.402
Even you must know
what kind of man Mikihisa Asakura is!

00:19:55.485 --> 00:19:56.778
What?

00:19:57.404 --> 00:20:00.866
Yeah. But what can I do?

00:20:00.949 --> 00:20:04.161
Despite appearances,
he's even more stubborn than Ren.

00:20:05.412 --> 00:20:07.956
He feels more guilt than anyone else

00:20:08.832 --> 00:20:12.544
<i>for letting Hao get away
all those years ago.</i>

00:20:15.172 --> 00:20:18.592
<i>So he kept climbing mountains.</i>

00:20:20.510 --> 00:20:24.389
<i>By shunning all worldly ties
and returning to nature,</i>

00:20:24.473 --> 00:20:26.558
<i>Ascetics attain supernatural powers.</i>

00:20:27.392 --> 00:20:30.938
<i>Deep in the mountains,
where all kinds of spirits wander,</i>

00:20:31.021 --> 00:20:34.316
<i>his mind and body,
worn down to their breaking point,</i>

00:20:34.399 --> 00:20:35.859
<i>encountered the world beyond.</i>

00:20:37.277 --> 00:20:39.821
I doubt there are many Ascetics like him

00:20:40.989 --> 00:20:45.410
<i>who have conquered the world's
tallest mountain, Chomolungma!</i>

00:21:13.021 --> 00:21:16.400
Do you still consider
yourself to be strong?

00:21:17.109 --> 00:21:19.444
Don't you think you should admit defeat?

00:21:20.445 --> 00:21:21.780
Just to let you know,

00:21:21.863 --> 00:21:24.783
I'm not planning on giving you
any slip-ups to capitalize on.

00:21:25.534 --> 00:21:28.829
Not only would doing so
be an insult to your soul,

00:21:28.912 --> 00:21:32.416
but it would also be trifling
compared with the ordeals that await you.

00:21:35.043 --> 00:21:37.546
If you still wish to continue,
that's fine by me.

00:21:38.255 --> 00:21:41.425
If you're foolish enough
to let your own pride kill you,

00:21:41.508 --> 00:21:44.303
then you're of no use to me anyway.

00:21:46.930 --> 00:21:48.015
Ren…

00:21:50.392 --> 00:21:52.269
I can't watch anymore…

00:21:55.355 --> 00:21:56.732
Old man.

00:21:57.316 --> 00:21:59.526
Yoh's dad or not,

00:21:59.609 --> 00:22:02.487
I can't sit back
and not do anything any longer!

00:22:03.238 --> 00:22:04.323
Horohoro…

00:22:08.452 --> 00:22:11.038
You're not going to get a turn.

00:22:11.955 --> 00:22:12.873
I shall

00:22:13.457 --> 00:22:15.000
not waver!

00:23:47.801 --> 00:23:50.178
<i>Next episode, "Farewell Forever."</i>

00:23:50.262 --> 00:23:51.888
Subtitle translation by: Lewis Williams
